# Everything the image does not need. Keeping this list right does two things:
# it keeps the build context small over a link that is already the slowest part
# of a push, and it keeps host artefacts — a Windows checkout's CRLF working
# copy, a stale `.next` — from being copied in and rebuilt against.

node_modules
.next
.git
.github

# Host-local and editor state.
.env.local
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store

# Test scratch written into node_modules by the suite.
.tmp-relayab-test

# `docs/` and `scripts/` are NOT excluded, and that is deliberate. Two things
# read them at runtime, from the running container rather than the repository:
#
#   src/lib/docs/protocol-doc.ts        → docs/模型适配协议/README.md
#     which is the whole media adaptation specification, and the one tool
#     (`get_media_spec_reference`) is built to hand the assistant verbatim.
#   src/components/docs/SpecCheckReference.tsx → scripts/spec-check.ts
#     which renders the validator's own source on /admin/docs/spec-check.
#
# Excluding them would not slow the build down; it would make both pages work
# in development and fail in production.
